Grammar time! Where is, ?. Listen. Where is the library? It is near the park.

18
00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:59.807
Your turn. Say it with me. Where is the library? It is near the park.

19
00:02:05.131 --> 00:02:11.525
In our town, there is a market, a library and a park. My mother works at the bank near the hospital.

20
00:02:11.575 --> 00:02:12.879
I like this story!

21
00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:18.937
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:18.987 --> 00:02:20.137
Library!

23
00:02:21.279 --> 00:02:26.649
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:26.699 --> 00:02:28.032
Post office!

25
00:02:29.238 --> 00:02:36.988
Think and answer. What places are near your house?

26
